- analyticsSnapshots, forecasts, actionPlans, demoBatches, appConfig/global (commissionPct, thresholds, showDemoListings, pinned): admin write; personal actionPlans owner read and write.
- admins/{uid}: no client write.
Provide firestore.indexes.json for every composite query and tell me to deploy it.

